PepoG fib SadgeBusiness n Wokege
    Hmmge peepoLessThan n 2 Wokege
        n.
    Bedge peepoShrug Wokege
        peepoFriendship fib PepegaCredit n 1 fib PepegaCredit n 2.
    Bedge
Bedge

PepoG printFibs SadgeBusiness upto current Wokege
    Hmmge peepoGreaterThan current upto Wokege
        peepoChat "all done".
    Bedge peepoShrug Wokege
        peepoChat "fib" current "=" fib current.
        printFibs upto peepoFriendship current 1.
    Bedge
Bedge

printFibs 10 0.
